  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "VRChat uses `web_embedded` in yt-dlp 2026.08.19 to play YouTube videos, however that's ongoing an A/B test at YouTube and may require PO tokens in the near future. This will break `web_embedded` as a guest visitor (the way VRChat uses yt-dlp).\n\nSee the upstream yt-dlp issue: https://github.com/yt-dlp/yt-dlp/issues/17989#issuecomment-6683964037\n\nSuggested action: Update to the latest yt-dlp version and use the `tv_samsung` extractor for format 18, to avoid the PO token requirement.",
